        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "While it is asleep, the user\nrandomly uses one of the moves\nit knows.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "While it is asleep, the user\nrandomly uses one of the moves\nit knows.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un coup puissant qui blesse la cible\net l’envoie balader. Dans la nature,\nmet fin au combat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user knocks away the target and\ndrags out another Pokémon in its party.\nIn the wild, the battle ends.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user knocks away the target and\ndrags out another Pokémon in its party.\nIn the wild, the battle ends.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "あいてを　はじきとばして\nひかえの　ポケモンを　ひきずりだす。\nやせいなら　せんとうが　おわる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상대를 튕겨내서\n교대할 포켓몬을 끌어낸다.\n야생의 경우에는 배틀이 끝난다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un coup puissant qui blesse la cible et l’envoie\nau loin. Dans la nature, met fin au combat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fegt das Ziel vom Feld und wechselt es\nmit einem anderen Pokémon aus.\nBeendet Kämpfe gegen wilde Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una saca donde guardar los objetos útiles para\nla exploración. Permite acceder al Subsuelo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa fa volar via il bersaglio in modo che\nvenga sostituito. Se il bersaglio è un singolo\nPokémon selvatico, la lotta finisce.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The target is knocked away, and a different\nPokémon is dragged out. In the wild, this\nends a battle against a single Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "相手を　はじきとばして\n控えの　ポケモンを　ひきずりだす。\n野生の　場合は　戦闘が　終わる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una saca donde guardar los objetos útiles para\nla exploración. Permite acceder al Subsuelo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
